(HEX FILE DOWNLOAD ALGORITHM) 73 701.67 T
1 10 Q
(This pseudo-code shows the algorithm used in the Intel Download Board to read the contents of the) 73 684.33 T
(FLASH memory) 73 672.33 T
(, and control the JT) 143.38 672.33 T
(AG pin signals.) 228.24 672.33 T
6 8 Q
(;********************************************************************) 73 661.67 T
(;* JTAG STAND-ALONE LOADER PSEUDO CODE) 73 653.67 T
(;* *) 73 645.67 T
(;* Author: John Logue) 73 637.67 T
(;* Revision Record: 06/17/93 JDL Initial Release - Version 1.0) 73 629.67 T
(;* *) 73 621.67 T
(;* This program typically executes in an embedded controller from an executable memory bank.) 73 613.67 T
(;* It transmits data from a local nonvolatile data memory bank to a JTAG \050IEEE 1149.1\051 chain,) 73 605.67 T
(;* typically to load the SRAM control memory in the FLEXlogic FPGAs in the chain.) 73 597.67 T
(;* *) 73 589.67 T
(;* Data is stored in the nonvolatile memory off-line, e.g., with a PROM programmer. It is) 73 581.67 T
(;* formatted as a JTAG data stream. Each byte contains TDO/TMS data for 4 TCKs. Bit 0 of) 73 573.67 T
(;* each byte is the f) 73 565.67 T
(irst TDO, bit 1 is the f) 173.8 565.67 T
(irst TMS, bit 2 is the second TDO,) 289 565.67 T
(;* etc. No inversion occurs between memory and TMS/TDO.) 73 557.67 T
(;* *) 73 549.67 T
(;* The f) 73 541.67 T
(irst four bytes in the nonvolatile memory specify the Ending Address + 1. The least) 111.4 541.67 T
(;* signif) 73 533.67 T
(icant byte is at data address 0. The JTAG data stream starts at data address 4.) 116.2 533.67 T
(;* *) 73 525.67 T
(;* The down-load operation takes place automatically each time the embedded controller is) 73 517.67 T
(; *reset, including power-on.) 73 509.67 T
(;********************************************************************) 73 501.67 T
(; Initialization) 73 493.67 T
( SET LED# port bit ; turn off LED) 73 485.67 T
( DELAY \050500\051 ; delay 500 ms.) 73 469.67 T
(; Give time for host JTAG string to completely power-up before beginning.) 73 461.67 T
( CLR TCK port bit ; init TCK to LOW) 73 445.67 T
( CLR RESET# port bit ; init RESET# to LOW \050activate host RESET\051) 73 437.67 T
( CLR CE# port bit ; enable Flash memory) 73 429.67 T
( CLR LED# port bit ; turn on LED) 73 421.67 T
(; Transmit data) 73 405.67 T
( adrs = 0; ; initialize data address and) 73 389.67 T
( last_adrs = \050adrs\051 ; last address + 1 \050these are 32 bit values\051) 73 381.67 T
( adrs = adrs + 4;) 73 373.67 T
( WHILE \050adrs < last_adrs\051) 73 357.67 T
( { ; loop until all data is moved from memory to JTAG chain) 73 349.67 T
( ; output 1st TMS/TDO) 73 333.67 T
( MOVE bit 0 of \050adrs\051 to TDO port bit) 73 325.67 T
( MOVE bit 1 of \050adrs\051 to TMS port bit) 73 317.67 T
( SET TCK port bit ; pulse TCK) 73 309.67 T
( CLR TCK port bit) 73 301.67 T
( ; output 2nd TMS/TDO) 73 285.67 T
( MOVE bit 2 of \050adrs\051 to TDO port bit) 73 277.67 T
( MOVE bit 3 of \050adrs\051 to TMS port bit) 73 269.67 T
( SET TCK port bit ; pulse TCK) 73 261.67 T
( CLR TCK port bit) 73 253.67 T
( ; output 3rd TMS/TDO) 73 237.67 T
( MOVE bit 4 of \050adrs\051 to TDO port bit) 73 229.67 T
( MOVE bit 5 of \050adrs\051 to TMS port bit) 73 221.67 T
( SET TCK port bit ; pulse TCK) 73 213.67 T
( CLR TCK port bit) 73 205.67 T
( ; output 4th TMS/TDO) 73 189.67 T
( MOVE bit 6 of \050adrs\051 to TDO port bit) 73 181.67 T
( MOVE bit 7 of \050adrs\051 to TMS port bit) 73 173.67 T
( SET TCK port bit ; pulse TCK) 73 165.67 T
( CLR TCK port bit) 73 157.67 T
( adrs = adrs + 1) 73 141.67 T
( }) 73 133.67 T
(; Completion) 73 117.67 T
( SET RESET# port bit ; release host) 73 109.67 T
( SET LED# port bit ; turn off LED) 73 101.67 T
( SET CE# port bit ; disable memory to save power) 73 93.67 T
( SLEEP ; disable embedded controller to save power) 73 85.67 T
